---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Teacher Dashboard
description: Each child's lessons, mastery tests, the skills where errors cluster, a chart of which facts are firm, and notes. All records stay in this browser.
permalink: /teacher/
bodyClass: page-level page-dashboard
---
<div class="level-page">
  <div class="level-page__inner">
    <header class="level-head">
      <div>
        <h1 class="level-head__title">Teacher dashboard</h1>
        <p class="level-head__facts">Records for each child, kept only in this browser</p>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline-dark no-print" onclick="window.print()">Print this report</button>
    </header>
    <div id="profile-selector" class="no-print"></div>
    <div id="dash"></div>
    <div class="progress-actions no-print">
      <span class="progress-actions__title">Records</span>
      <button class="btn btn--outline-dark" id="btn-export-progress" type="button">Save a backup</button>
      <button class="btn btn--outline-dark" id="btn-import-progress" type="button">Load a backup</button>
      <button class="btn btn--outline-dark" id="btn-reset-progress" type="button">Erase this child's records</button>
      <input type="file" id="import-progress-input" class="progress-import-input" accept=".json" hidden>
    </div>
    <p class="level-section-note no-print">Records live in this browser only. Save a backup now and then, and load it on another device to carry records over. Clearing the browser's site data erases them.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<script id="dash-data" type="application/json">{{ program.summary | dump | safe }}</script>
<script src="/assets/js/progress.js?v={{ build.version }}"></script>
<script src="/assets/js/dashboard.js?v={{ build.version }}" defer></script>
